# The chat tries providers in order: Gemini first, then Groq. Whichever answers
# first wins; a provider that fails BEFORE producing any text is skipped
# silently and the next one is tried. Set either, or both, or neither — with no
# key at all the chat serves its canned answers and never breaks.

# Google Gemini — https://aistudio.google.com/apikey. Free tier, no card.
# This is the primary provider, and the reason is throughput: the whole system
# prompt (~5,800 tokens, most of it PORTFOLIO_AI_knowledge.md) is re-sent on
# every single message, and Gemini's free tier is measured in hundreds of
# thousands of tokens per minute against Groq's 12,000.
GEMINI_AI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to gemini-flash-latest. Prefer the `-latest` alias over a
# pinned version: gemini-2.5-flash was retired for new keys and began returning
# 404, and an alias that keeps working is worth more here than one that cannot
# drift under you.
GEMINI_MODEL=

# Groq API key — https://console.groq.com. Do NOT add a payment method to the
# account: the free tier is the spending guarantee for this feature.
# Now the understudy rather than the primary. Its free tier allows 12,000 tokens
# per minute and 100,000 per day, which at ~5,800 tokens a message is roughly
# 2 messages a minute and 17 a day across all visitors — enough to stand in when
# Gemini is down, not enough to carry the site.
GROQ_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to llama-3.3-70b-versatile — leave it unset.
#
# This used to recommend llama-3.1-8b-instant for "much higher free-tier daily
# headroom". That is true of the DAILY cap and badly misleading in practice: the
# binding limit here is tokens per MINUTE, and 8b-instant's is 6,000 against
# 70b's 12,000. The whole system prompt is re-sent on every message (~3,300
# tokens), so 8b-instant allows roughly one message a minute and 70b allows
# three. Switching "up" to the smaller model halves your throughput.
#
# If the chat is falling back to canned answers, the cause is almost always a
# Groq 429 — check the logs for "provider stream failed". Trim
# PORTFOLIO_AI_knowledge.md before reaching for a different model; it is
# re-sent in full on every single request.
GROQ_MODEL=

# Resend API key — https://resend.com. Do NOT add a payment method: the free
# tier (3,000/month, 100/day) is the spending guarantee for this feature.
# Without a verified domain Resend only delivers to the account's own address,
# which is the only recipient here. Unset means the chat's send button falls
# back to a mailto, which is the pre-existing behaviour.
RESEND_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to PORTFOLIO.email. On the free tier this must be the
# Resend account's own address.
CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=
